ic mean of two finite numeric inputs.\n\n    Examples:\n        >>> compute(2, 3)\n        2.5\n        >>> compute(0, -4)\n        -2.0\n        >>> compute(-1.5, 2.5)\n        0.5\n\n    Zero, negative and fractional values are supported. Non-numeric or\n    non-finite inputs (e.g. ``NaN`` or ``inf``) raise ``ValueError``.\n    \"\"\"\n    return mean_values(a, b)\n", "output_paths_kind": "read_only_capture_evidence", "business_path": "src/main.py", "workspace": "/Users/ayang/Desktop/project_work/Chimera/docs/dataset-evaluation/reports/stage2/full-from-scratch-20261015/q2-q3/failure-rerun-20261016/tasks/q2-t0369/study/workspaces/retry-q2-t0369-t0001", "execution_environment": {"cwd": "/Users/ayang/Desktop/project_work/Chimera/docs/dataset-evaluation/reports/stage2/full-from-scratch-20261015/q2-q3/failure-rerun-20261016/tasks/q2-t0369/study/workspaces/retry-q2-t0369-t0001", "python_executable": "/opt/anaconda3/bin/python", "default_build_command": "/opt/anaconda3/bin/python -m compileall -q src", "build_kind": "python_bytecode_compilation", "optional_modules": {"pytest": true, "build": false, "pip": true, "setuptools": true}}}, "status": "success", "schema_version": "chimera-event/1", "event_seq": 17, "event_id": "2666144321b94e3abb095adbdf49773f", "wall_time_utc": "2026-10-16T07:52:59.318863+00:00", "simulation_clock_kind": "task_start_plus_logical_order"}
